  designNotes: "2026-09-01, user request (\u9023\u7E8C\u523A\u5200.zip \u7684 Meshy_AI_Parkside_Portrait_biped
    Animation - same pipeline as Wushi_DoubleCombo). Clip 'ContinuousThrust' (Scene
    take, without_skin FBX 205KB, 92 frames / 3.033s, imported Humanoid, XZ baked
    in-place). SHARED with the Player (F execution - Maya NewAnimator 'ExecuteThrust'
    state). A 5-jab continuous thrust; measured offline via AnimationMode.SampleAnimationClip
    retargeted onto the live 4x Wushi, reading BladeHitbox world pos vs Chest (fwd-of-hips
    + speed):\\n jab1 nt 0.045-0.10  (blade fwd 2.6, Y~3.0, whips back at 0.10 spd
    92)\\n jab2 nt 0.22-0.29   (fwd 2.1, Y~3.0)\\n jab3 nt 0.335-0.385 (fwd 2.55,
    Y~4.1 - head-height stab)\\n jab4 nt 0.445-0.495 (fwd 2.6, Y~4.5)\\n jab5 nt
    0.575-0.665 (fwd 3.3 DEEPEST, Y~2.0 - committed low lunge, dmgMult 1.3; blade
    then parked forward 0.67-0.77 = no new hit; 0.8-1.0 = blade-pull recovery).\\nhealthDamageIsPercentOfTargetMax=true,
    baseHealthDamage=1 => 1% per jab, ~5% for the full 5-hit combo (respects '\u5927\u62DB\u4EE5\u5916\u56FA\u5B9A\u62635%').
    poise 3/jab (~15 total, near DoubleCombo's 24). maxDistance 2.8 (Meshy 'starts
    behind root' caveat - see DoubleCombo notes; useRootMotion=0 first pass, baked
    in-place). WINDOWS NEED IN-PLAY CONFIRMATION on the live boss (frames-advancing)
    before shipping."
